{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_title", "source_sha256": "05996c022eda2a6fe09b588025ccd02500648cbd57f5b8fed1c5d90c4fe39be3", "ja": "星梨花とおでかけ1", "zh": "与星梨花外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d78f1a24e5cf6e02073c332ed2b73433596963b9f60be829f563ab43a8659bcc", "ja": "星梨花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与星梨花外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ecf73228eb3d2cdbf417539ebf4d4365a6856d38bfa9864e7e7beb4e91338982", "ja": "（ツアー中、北海道のあちこちで営業をしている。\n今日は星梨花と、札幌の街レポの仕事だ）", "zh": "（巡演期间，我们在北海道各地进行宣传活动。今天要和星梨花一起做札幌街头报道的工作）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "17edbcf94d9226a896d2173d233b6e31a44665a133832361f5d4bdc9f582ac09", "ja": "ふぁ……んん。\nあ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "哈……嗯。\n啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc676571b206d3e03ae94dc300fb72914f66bc0916ae690bd25a93fddac6c702", "ja": "星梨花、お疲れさま。眠いか？\nいつもなら、もう家に帰ってる時間だもんな。", "zh": "星梨花，辛苦了。困了吗？\n平时这个时间，你已经回到家了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "dbb149de7a70f5ce77c5b13791a8673eee75d14820f5c46877ef255af9a6a3c9", "ja": "大丈夫です！　これから行くお店は、\n夜にパフェを食べるんですよね？", "zh": "没事的！接下来要去的那家店，\n是在晚上吃芭菲的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bd1bb9212f0fd3904fbcb46ba6181455246ede3345a7930d23f3884bec14e6c3", "ja": "ああ。食事のシメにパフェを食べるのが、\n札幌で流行ってるらしいんだ。その取材だな。", "zh": "啊。据说在札幌，吃完饭后吃芭菲最近很流行。我们就是去采访这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "8987357dd100550f2fff0cf08cdeb64cb8dc03019171e26160b4dbff06de4169", "ja": "わたし、夜にパフェを食べるなんて初めてです！\nどんなパフェなんでしょう……。", "zh": "我还是第一次在晚上吃芭菲呢！  \n会是什么样的芭菲呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "8dc56fe45cd6d144c75ea9f1b96fa0bb264be99029f7edd024e870034eaeb12a", "ja": "それに、お仕事じゃなかったら、夜は出かけたり\nできないので……なんだかドキドキしますね♪", "zh": "而且，如果不是因为工作，晚上就不能出门……总觉得有些心跳加速呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "49bfef3b92aca2cea815b155c7c1460f2df0181995b56cd08bab971acc75ab37", "ja": "そうだな。仕事とはいえ、その土地の風物に\n触れられるのもツアーの醍醐味だ。楽しもうな！", "zh": "是啊。虽然是工作，但能亲身感受当地的风土人情，\n也是巡演的一大乐趣。好好享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser01_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "a18f584edf5b0a722a946666caaba040efcdb59bd260e21bc1cb54dd57cb9c2b", "ja": "はい！　パフェのレポート、がんばります♪", "zh": "好的！我会努力写好芭菲的报道♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
